The culprit is likely the constant in the equation (1.2). In an unstandardized metric b1 is larger than  1.2*b2 but in a standardized metric b1 is smaller than 1.2*b2. When you're introducing a constant into a defined parameter, there's no guarantee that unstandardized and standardized slopes would have the same sign.

