From ubfa43814f6ba1969 at groups.google.com  Mon May 20 09:01:37 2019
From: ubfa43814f6ba1969 at groups.google.com (=?utf-8?b?UsO2bmtrw7YsIE1pa2tv?=)
Date: Mon, 20 May 2019 09:01:37 +0000
Subject: Re: Non-continuous SEM: Goodnes of Fit indices
Message-ID: <S61frPhquic.iXiP1iqTBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/S61frPhquic/m/iXiP1iqTBQAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
