Subject: Re: Measurement Invariance [lavaan WARNING: scaling factor is negative]
Message-ID: <m9gqzB7mlrw.3Qr5xVZsAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <m9gqzB7mlrw.HlduoM41DAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <m9gqzB7mlrw.HlduoM41DAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
