>   lavaan ERROR: sample covariance matrix is not positive-definite
>
> Cov.lv output prior to the group= "gender" is

The covariance matrix for the single entire group is irrelevant.  The error is caused when there is a separate covariance matrix for each group.  Furthermore, your error message is about the sample covariance matrix, not the covariance matrix of latent variables (cov.lv <http://cov.lv>).

